{%- comment -%}
  The OAuth scope a tool call needs (docs/oauth.md): mcp:write for a tool whose
  manifest declares mutating:true, mcp:read for anything else. Single source for the
  inline tools/call path and approval/execute.

  @param {object} tool - the resolved manifest
  @return {string}
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
  if tool.mutating
    return 'mcp:write'
  endif
  return 'mcp:read'
%}
